  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uovU77U.png\" alt=\"1\"></p><p><strong>清新纹理</strong> —— 这是一款独特的资源包，通过融合多种资源包整合而成的大型和谐组合。其目标是焕新并提升原版《我的世界》的熟悉体验，赋予其全新色彩与现代化音效。我们的核心使命是重新构想游戏的经典纹理，为其注入活力与灵感，让游戏体验更加激动人心。此外，该资源包还提供广泛的模组支持，使其尽可能满足各类玩家的多样化偏好，兼具通用性与吸引力。</p><h2>⚙️ 兼容性</h2><p>建议使用以下模组以确保资源包的完整兼容性：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[EMF] 实体模型特性</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[ETF] 实体纹理特性</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcit-resewn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CIT Resewn</a>（可选）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polytone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Polytone</a>（可选）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a>（可选）</li>\n</ul><h2>💬 社区</h2><p>加入我们的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/nSJBpkeVv6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器社区</a>，一起聊天、提问或分享你的创作吧！</p><h2>❗ 使用资源</h2><p>制作“清新纹理”时参考或使用的资源包：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/true-harmony\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">True Harmony</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/torches-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Torches Reimagined</a>&nbsp;—— 采用了火把的3D模型并稍作修改</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/chests-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chests Reimagined</a>&nbsp;—— 使用了箱子与陷阱箱的纹理</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fextended-illumina%252fversions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended lantern</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/hidyks-realm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hidyk's Realm</a> —— 大部分纹理来源于此！</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252frefined-enchants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Refined Enchants</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcubic-sun-moon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cubic Sun &amp; Moon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fretextured-dye\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Retextured Dyes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fretextured-minecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Retextured Minecraft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsaddles-squared\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Saddles Squared</a> —— 基于 Apache-2.0 许可证</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252farcheryrevamped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Archery Revamped</a> —— 编辑版</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252farmor-trim-preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Armor Trim Preview</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbrush-and-juice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Brush &amp; Juice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/modded-omelet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modded Omelet - Modern Spawn Eggs</a></li>\n</ul><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:775px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/husSXOLw-iw?t=438&amp;si=zPlv-4vILgZQGNiC\" width=\"775\" height=\"455\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>",
